# pattern wins. Owners are auto-requested for review on PRs touching their files.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                              @devparanjay

# Build & CI ownership stays with the maintainer until specialized owners exist.
/scripts/                      @devparanjay
/build/                        @devparanjay
/.github/workflows/            @devparanjay

# Patches need extra eyes — the patch set is the riskiest part of the project.
/patches/                      @devparanjay

# Documentation
/docs/                         @devparanjay
